  "fields": {
    "name": "Postgres Service Registration",
    "responsibility": "Stands ArgentSea up in a host for PostgreSQL: binds the configuration sections to the PostgreSQL settings objects and registers, as injectable singletons, the collection of configured databases and the collection of configured shard sets — each already wired to the Npgsql provider services. It also fixes the file extension under which statement-file queries are looked up, which is process-wide rather than per-provider state.",
